    </l>
    <l n="5" para="true">Ἐνλέχια, folertia, calliditas: Angl.</l>
    <l n="6">
      <bl>trick,</bl> &amp; <bl>tricke,</bl> id est, sophismata:</l>
    <l n="7">Ἐντυγχάνει, incurrit, convenit, quadrat, ap-</l>
    <l n="8">tum est, <bl>to be trigg.</bl> in eam sententi-</l>
    <l n="9">am non semel audivisse mihi videor.</l>
